                "title": "PS23395 - Consultations on Nuclear Policy",
                "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\n\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a mini competition under the Crown Commercial Services DPS framework RM6126 - Research and Insights.\r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\n\r\nThe Department for Energy Security and Net Zero (DESNZ), requires external support with experience in analysing responses to the government consultation. The winning bidder would be expected to work with the Nuclear National Policy Statement and Alternative Routes to Market team leads and policy officials.",
